 "name_en": "Freight Settlement – Basic TM (7IX)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Freight Settlement – Basic TM (7IX)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio4c86b37e48ee4237a238ecc2b724559b\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio4c86b37e48ee4237a238ecc2b724559b__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Freight costs calculated for the freight documents (freight orders and freight bookings) are to be posted in financial accounting to record such costs in accounting as accruals and to pay the carriers or freight forwarders. Once the freight documents are in a status in which the transportation has been initiated or completed, the freight costs can be posted to financial accounting. The invoice received from the carrier or freight forwarder is verified against the expected costs calculated in the freight document.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio4c86b37e48ee4237a238ecc2b724559b__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loio4c86b37e48ee4237a238ecc2b724559b__ul_qss_g2n_ccc\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Freight Cost Accrual Posting</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Monitor Freight Cost Allocation Documents</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Carrier Settlement for Freight Documents</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio4c86b37e48ee4237a238ecc2b724559b__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Support the accrual of freight costs in financial accounting and the preparation for invoice processing of freight documents</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Allocate freight costs at freight document level and delivery item in a freight document. The system posts the costs to material valuation in an inbound process and to expense account (general ledger) in an outbound process</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>货运结算 – 基本 TM (7IX)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio4c86b37e48ee4237a238ecc2b724559b\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio4c86b37e48ee4237a238ecc2b724559b__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">为货运凭证（货运订单和货运预订）计算的货运成本将在财务会计中过账，以在会计核算中将此类成本记录为应计，并向运输公司或货运代理商付款。货运凭证处于启动或完成运输的状态后，可以将货运成本过账到财务会计。根据货运凭证中计算的预期成本，验证从承运方或货运代理商收到的发票。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio4c86b37e48ee4237a238ecc2b724559b__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loio4c86b37e48ee4237a238ecc2b724559b__ul_qss_g2n_ccc\">\n       <li class=\"li\">货运成本应计过账</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">监控货运成本分配凭证</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">货运凭证的运输公司结算</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio4c86b37e48ee4237a238ecc2b724559b__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">支持财务会计中的货运成本应计，以及货运凭证的发票处理准备</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在货运凭证级别分配货运成本，在货运凭证中分配交货项目。系统将成本过账到收货流程中的物料评估，并过账到出库流程中的费用科目（总账）</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
